      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(usage-bar): evict oldest template cache entry when full",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nEach cached usage bar template file holds a live `fs.watch` watcher. The module-level `Map` grew without bound, accumulating watchers and memory for every distinct template file path ever loaded. The only cleanup was via `clearUsageBarTemplateCacheForTest()`.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAdd `MAX_CACHED_TEMPLATES = 32` limit. When filling, close the oldest watcher and remove it before inserting the new one.\n\n## User Impact\n\nPrevents unbounded watcher/memory growth when usage bar templates are loaded from changing file paths.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `translator.test.ts`: 13/13 passed ✅",
